From: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
Subject: [DRAFT PATCH 1/3] drm/sun4i: planes: add sun55i-a523 DE33 planes

DRAFT - staged on top of Jernej Skrabec's "[PATCH v2 0/8] drm/sun4i: update
DE33 support" (patch 6 "Add planes driver"), which is NOT merged yet. Hunk
offsets are UNVERIFIED until that series lands; regenerate + `git apply --check`
then. See kernel/staged-de33-a523/README.md.

The A523 (sun55iw3) DE3.5 uses the same shared-planes model as the H616 DE3.3:
planes are a resource shared between mixers, assigned via the port->channel mux
in the display-clock/DE-top register space. Add an A523 planes quirks entry and
compatible.

def_map: A523 BSP (de350) exposes 3 VI (ch 0..2) + 3 UI (ch 6..8); stock routes
{0,1,6,7,8} to disp0. This draft starts with {0,6,7} (a UI primary at index 1,
matching H616); the final channel set/order is a hardware-verify item. disp1 is
unused - the A523 drives a single DSI panel.

Signed-off-by: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
---
 .../display/allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes.yaml |  1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c              | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
       - allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes
+      - allwinner,sun55i-a523-de33-planes
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c
@@ -31,11 +31,36 @@ static const struct sun50i_planes_quirks sun50i_h616_planes_quirks = {
 	},
 };
 
+/*
+ * A523 (sun55iw3) DE3.5 - DE33-class, single display (disp0). The A523 BSP
+ * (de350) exposes 3 VI (ch 0..2) + 3 UI (ch 6..8); stock routes {0,1,6,7,8}
+ * to disp0. This draft uses {0,6,7} (UI primary at index 1, like H616); the
+ * final channel set/order is a hardware-verify item. disp1 is unused.
+ */
+static const struct sun50i_planes_quirks sun55i_a523_planes_quirks = {
+	.def_map = {
+		{
+			.map = {0, 6, 7},
+			.num_ch = 3,
+		},
+	},
+	.cfg = {
+		.de_type	= SUN8I_MIXER_DE33,
+		/* TODO: enable scaling once the driver supports it (as H616) */
+		.scaler_mask	= 0,
+		.scanline_yuv	= 4096,
+	},
+};
+
 static const struct of_device_id sun50i_planes_of_table[] = {
 	{
 		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-de33-planes",
 		.data = &sun50i_h616_planes_quirks
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "allwinner,sun55i-a523-de33-planes",
+		.data = &sun55i_a523_planes_quirks
+	},
 	{ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, sun50i_planes_of_table);
